<li><strong>Your Google Business Profile is your highest-ROI asset.</strong> Most competitors have barely touched theirs. A fully optimized profile generates 15–40 calls per month for free.</li>
<li><strong>Storm damage leads are the highest-value opportunities.</strong> They close at 30–50% with average job values of $8,500–$25,000. Pre-built campaigns let you capture them within hours, not days.</li>
<li><strong>Referrals convert at 40–60% — the highest rate of any channel.</strong> A structured program with real incentives turns happy customers into a predictable lead source.</li>
<li><strong>Winter is for building, not waiting.</strong> Content created in January ranks in March. Relationships built in December pay off in April. Use slow season strategically.</li>
</ul>
